id:                     E3350
title: 共享对象重新bless后的每引用重载状态刷新
trigger_tool: perl|conan|make
phase: runtime-validation|testing
error_signature: SvAMAGIC reference versus referent|overloaded alias rebless state
severity:               2
category:               compat, perl, runtime
match_keywords: SvAMAGIC|rebless|overload.{0,40}alias|重载.{0,30}别名|重新bless
root_cause: Perl重载标志是引用的属性，修改共享对象的blessing不能据此推断每个别名引用缓存的重载状态已经同步。
affected_scope: 共享对象重新bless后的每引用重载状态刷新
verification_cmd: 同源未改模块与完整原make test，实际Conan安装消费者和目标运行语义分别核验。
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: preserve-original-language-runtime-contract
rec_description: 保留原overload.t所有12断言和上游重新bless步骤；分别核对实际字符串化值、对象类型、第二引用刷新及最终引用地址，不删掉重载场景或仅用标量相等替代。
rec_command: make test TEST_VERBOSE=1
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: original module and full upstream test source with real installed package binding
